WEBVTT

00:06:28.551 --> 00:06:31.095
From our very first history lessons,

00:06:31.137 --> 00:06:34.515
we're taught to believe
that our modern world,

00:06:34.557 --> 00:06:37.852
with all of its advantages and amenities,

00:06:37.893 --> 00:06:40.104
modern health care, space travel,

00:06:40.146 --> 00:06:42.940
all the things that are good and exciting,

00:06:42.982 --> 00:06:45.151
couldn't possibly exist

00:06:45.151 --> 00:06:48.529
without that original
concentration of humanity

00:06:48.529 --> 00:06:51.282
into larger and larger units

00:06:51.282 --> 00:06:56.829
and the relentless buildup
of inequalities that came with it.

00:06:56.829 --> 00:07:00.749
Inequality, we're taught to believe,